# Shared bugfix sync across related ArtQTML codebases

When fixing a bug on a **shared behavior / shared code path** in this plugin, also port the same fix in the same decision round to any related private ArtQTML codebase the maintainer tracks.

Do **not** copy product-specific features across variants — only shared bugfixes and shared behavior.
